  "decision_needed": [
    {
      "question": "The General Fund 'Intergovernmental' line (64,241, p4) equals the budget schedule's Sales tax 47,381 + Equalization 16,860 (p7), and the Statement of Activities prints 'Sales taxes 47,381' (p2). Should the statement's Intergovernmental line be split into sales tax and state aid?",
